---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base page="studio" title="XR Studio for Business | Wizardlenz XR Studio" description="Training simulations, virtual showrooms, AR product views, immersive events, and XR games and AI experiences, from first prototype to launch.">
<div class="view" id="v-studio" data-view="studio">
<section class="pg-hero" aria-labelledby="stH1">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="crumb"><a href="/" data-portal="Home">Home</a> / Studio</p>
    <h1 class="pg-h1" id="stH1" data-decode>XR that does a real job for your business.</h1>
    <p class="lead">We design and build immersive experiences that train people, sell products and draw crowds, from a first prototype to launch and handover.</p>
    <div class="cta-row"><a class="btn btn-primary mag" href="/contact/" data-portal="Contact">Book a discovery call</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="stWhat" style="padding-top:40px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">What we build</p>
    <h2 class="h2" id="stWhat" data-decode>Four ways we put XR to work.</h2>
    <div class="svcs">
      <div class="svc spot"><canvas class="svcv" data-svc="train" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M6 30c0-8 8-12 18-12s18 4 18 12v4H6z"/><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M14 22v-6a10 10 0 0 1 20 0v6M18 34v6m12-6v6"/></svg><h3>Training simulations</h3><p>Practise risky or costly tasks safely in VR, as often as your team needs.</p></div>
      <div class="svc spot"><canvas class="svcv" data-svc="show" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M24 6l16 9v18l-16 9-16-9V15z"/><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M24 24l16-9M24 24v18M24 24L8 15"/></svg><h3>Virtual showrooms and AR product views</h3><p>Let customers explore your products at full scale, on any phone.</p></div>
      <div class="svc spot"><canvas class="svcv" data-svc="event" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M6 18h36v14a4 4 0 0 1-4 4h-8l-4-5h-4l-4 5h-8a4 4 0 0 1-4-4z"/><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M14 26h4m12 0h4M24 6v6"/></svg><h3>Immersive events</h3><p>XR experiences with on-site support for launches, expos and campus fests.</p></div>
      <div class="svc spot"><canvas class="svcv" data-svc="ai" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M12 17h24a7 7 0 0 1 7 7v6a4 4 0 0 1-7 2.5L33 29H15l-3 2.5A4 4 0 0 1 5 30v-6a7 7 0 0 1 7-7z"/><path pathLength="1" class="draw" d="M16 21.5v6M13 24.5h6M31 23h.01M35 26h.01"/></svg><h3>XR games and AI experiences</h3><p>Custom games and AI-powered features for headsets, phones and PCs: game-based learning, AI characters and smart assistants.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="chip-label" style="margin-top:40px">Industries we build for</p>
    <div class="chips"><span class="chip">Education</span><span class="chip">Healthcare</span><span class="chip">Retail and real estate</span><span class="chip">Manufacturing</span><span class="chip">Events and expos</span></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="howH" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p>
    <h2 class="h2" id="howH" data-decode>From first call to launch.</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><h3>Discover</h3><p>We learn your goal, audience and budget, and tell you honestly what XR can do for it.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Prototype</h3><p>A quick working prototype you can try, so decisions are made on something real.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Build</h3><p>Full development with regular demos, so you see progress as it happens.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Launch and train</h3><p>We deploy, hand over, and train your team to run it.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="padding-top:0" aria-label="Have a project in mind?">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="band"><div><h2 class="h2" style="margin:0">Have a project in mind?</h2><p class="lead" style="font-size:17px">Tell us the goal. We will tell you honestly what XR can do for it.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary mag" href="/contact/" data-portal="Contact">Book a discovery call</a></div></div>
</section>
</div>
</Base>
